{
    "title": "Offroad Jeep Driving - 3D Game",
    "description": "\u2699\ufe0f<font color=\"blue\">Game Features:</font>\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udea9 Different types of wrangler jeeps are available\r\n\ud83d\udea9 A unique jeep driving physics\r\n\ud83d\udea9 Awesome 3D mountains and offroad design\r\n\ud83d\udea9 Multiple missions for your enjoyment including jeep driving and parking\r\n\ud83d\udea9 Offroad mountain hill tracks\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f<font color=\"blue\">Are you a fan of offroad driving games?</font>\r\n\r\nGamePark presents a jeep game named as Offroad Jeep Driving & Parking in which you will experience a jeep simulator by driving a jeep on offroad bumpy roads to transport logs and many other things from one place to another. The beautiful 3d environments with ultimate mountain hill roads will be a dangerous task for you because you have to drive the jeep very carefully. Let's enjoy offroad driving!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25<font color=\"blue\">The fun didn't ends here!</font>\r\n\r\nA variety of 4x4 vehicles are available for your entertainment including suv, trucks and mountain offroad jeeps which will be bought with the ingame currency. Drive as much as you can and earn the ingame currency so you can buy your desired vehicle car for your enjoyment. It's an ultimate jeep driving game for all jeep games fans!",
    "descriptionHTML": "\u2699\ufe0f<font color=\"blue\">Game Features:</font><br><br>\ud83d\udea9 Different types of wrangler jeeps are available<br>\ud83d\udea9 A unique jeep driving physics<br>\ud83d\udea9 Awesome 3D mountains and offroad design<br>\ud83d\udea9 Multiple missions for your enjoyment including jeep driving and parking<br>\ud83d\udea9 Offroad mountain hill tracks<br><br>\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f\ud83c\udf1f<font color=\"blue\">Are you a fan of offroad driving games?</font><br><br>GamePark presents a jeep game named as Offroad Jeep Driving &amp; Parking in which you will experience a jeep simulator by driving a jeep on offroad bumpy roads to transport logs and many other things from one place to another. The beautiful 3d environments with ultimate mountain hill roads will be a dangerous task for you because you have to drive the jeep very carefully. Let&#39;s enjoy offroad driving!<br><br>\ud83d\udd25<font color=\"blue\">The fun didn&#39;t ends here!</font><br><br>A variety of 4x4 vehicles are available for your entertainment including suv, trucks and mountain offroad jeeps which will be bought with the ingame currency. Drive as much as you can and earn the ingame currency so you can buy your desired vehicle car for your enjoyment. It&#39;s an ultimate jeep driving game for all jeep games fans!",
    "summary": "A 4x4 jeep driving game to drive a jeep on mountains and offroad muddy tracks.",
